            "label": "Trumpet!",
            "cue": "trumpet"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "And a trunk has no bones at all, just thousands of muscles. That's why it can bend every which way.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "img:Human_physiology/Servier/muscle-1",
        "text": "No bones, lots of muscles",
